.TH GITHUB-L10N 1 "2026-02-15" "Daniel Nylander" "GitHub L10n Manual"
.SH NAME
github-l10n - Scan GitHub repos for missing translations
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B github-l10n
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBgithub-l10n\fR is a GTK4/Adwaita application that scans popular open-source GitHub repositories and shows which ones have or lack translations for a given language. It searches for .po, .ts, and .xliff files, supports filtering by translation status, drill-down to specific files, optional GitHub token for higher rate limits, and local caching.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-help
Show help message and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/github-l10n/
Configuration files.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/github-l10n/
Cached data.
.SH BUGS
Report bugs at https://github.com/yeager/github-l10n/issues
.SH AUTHOR
Daniel Nylander <daniel@danielnylander.se>
.SH SEE ALSO
Project homepage: https://github.com/yeager/github-l10n
